3.6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.7pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 11pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(※ 선발시 마일리지(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5점</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">) 지급 - 센터 참여 학생에 한함.)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">3. 신청기한 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"> 2011. 08. 22(월) ~ 09. 02(금)까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: -5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">4. 실시기간 : 2011. 09. 15. ~ 2012. 01. 31.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; TEXT-INDENT: -44.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">5. 대상업체 : 첨부2.(업체 list) 참조</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 90%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모